sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Folio
    participant WS as WebSocket
    participant API as ChatController
    participant State as Redis Generation State
    participant MySQL

    User->>Folio: reopen tab or network reconnects
    Folio->>WS: reconnect with access token + stable clientId
    WS-->>Folio: connection handshake
    alt browser knows pending generationId
        Folio->>API: GET /chat/generation/{generationId}
        API->>State: getGenerationForUser
    else no local generationId
        Folio->>API: GET /chat/active-generation?clientId=...
        API->>State: getActiveGenerationForUserAndClient
    end
    State-->>Folio: owned snapshot or empty
    alt STREAMING
        Folio->>Folio: restore pending assistant + progress state
        loop no stream content change for 8 seconds
            Folio->>API: GET generation snapshot every 2 seconds
            API->>State: read current status
            State-->>Folio: STREAMING / terminal snapshot
        end
    else COMPLETED
        Folio->>Folio: apply terminal snapshot
        Folio->>MySQL: reload persisted conversation when needed
    else FAILED or CANCELLED
        Folio->>Folio: stop loading state and show terminal result
        Folio->>MySQL: restore persisted branch after failed Retry
    end
    Note over API,State: All generation reads are scoped to the authenticated user<br/>clientId prevents one tab from adopting another tab's active run
